<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<meta name="description" content="About Husain Farooqui — Future Doctor, Researcher and Lifelong Learner.">
<title>About — Husain Farooqui</title>

<style>
:root{
  --bg:#05070d;
  --text:#eef3ff;
  --muted:#9aa7bd;
  --cyan:#00e5ff;
  --purple:#8b6cff;
  --line:rgba(255,255,255,.09);
  --card:rgba(13,18,30,.72);
}

*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}

body{
  font-family:Inter,system-ui,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",sans-serif;
  color:var(--text);
  background:
    radial-gradient(circle at 15% 10%,rgba(139,108,255,.14),transparent 30%),
    radial-gradient(circle at 85% 20%,rgba(0,229,255,.10),transparent 28%),
    var(--bg);
  line-height:1.75;
}

a{text-decoration:none;color:inherit}

nav{
  position:sticky;
  top:0;
  z-index:10;
  height:70px;
  padding:0 6%;
  display:flex;
  align-items:center;
  justify-content:space-between;
  border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);
  background:rgba(5,7,13,.82);
  backdrop-filter:blur(18px);
}

.logo{
  font-size:26px;
  font-weight:800;
}

.logo span{
  color:var(--cyan);
}

.home{
  padding:9px 17px;
  border:1px solid var(--line);
  border-radius:999px;
  transition:.3s;
}

.home:hover{
  color:var(--cyan);
  border-color:var(--cyan);
  transform:translateY(-2px);
}

main{
  max-width:1100px;
  margin:auto;
  padding:80px 24px 100px;
}

.hero{
  text-align:center;
  margin-bottom:75px;
}

.eyebrow{
  color:var(--cyan);
  font-size:12px;
  letter-spacing:.2em;
  text-transform:uppercase;
  font-weight:700;
}

.hero h1{
  font-size:clamp(48px,8vw,82px);
  line-height:1;
  margin:16px 0;
  letter-spacing:-.055em;
}

.hero h1 span{
  background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--purple),var(--cyan));
  -webkit-background-clip:text;
  background-clip:text;
  color:transparent;
}

.hero p{
  color:var(--muted);
  font-size:18px;
}

.profile{
  display:grid;
  grid-template-columns:350px 1fr;
  gap:55px;
  align-items:center;
  margin-bottom:75px;
}

.photo-wrap{
  padding:2px;
  border-radius:30px;
  background:linear-gradient(145deg,var(--purple),var(--cyan));
  box-shadow:0 0 60px rgba(0,229,255,.13);
}

.photo{
  display:block;
  width:100%;
  aspect-ratio:4/5;
  object-fit:cover;
  border-radius:28px;
  background:#111722;
}

.content h2{
  font-size:38px;
  line-height:1.15;
  margin:12px 0 20px;
  letter-spacing:-.035em;
}

.content h2 span{
  color:var(--cyan);
}

.content p{
  color:var(--muted);
  font-size:16px;
  margin-bottom:18px;
}

.grid{
  display:grid;
  grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);
  gap:18px;
}

.card{
  padding:28px;
  border:1px solid var(--line);
  border-radius:22px;
  background:var(--card);
  backdrop-filter:blur(16px);
  transition:.3s;
}

.card:hover{
  transform:translateY(-5px);
  border-color:rgba(0,229,255,.28);
}

.icon{
  font-size:24px;
  margin-bottom:10px;
}

.card h3{
  font-size:19px;
  margin-bottom:8px;
}

.card p{
  color:var(--muted);
  font-size:14px;
}

.wide{
  margin-top:18px;
  padding:32px;
  border:1px solid var(--line);
  border-radius:24px;
  background:linear-gradient(
    135deg,
    rgba(139,108,255,.08),
    rgba(0,229,255,.05)
  );
}

.wide h2{
  font-size:28px;
  margin-bottom:10px;
}

.wide p{
  color:var(--muted);
}

footer{
  text-align:center;
  color:#66738a;
  font-size:12px;
  border-top:1px solid var(--line);
  margin-top:75px;
  padding-top:40px;
}

@media(max-width:760px){

  nav{
    height:64px;
    padding:0 18px;
  }

  main{
    padding:55px 18px 80px;
  }

  .profile{
    grid-template-columns:1fr;
    gap:35px;
  }

  .photo-wrap{
    max-width:330px;
    margin:auto;
  }

  .grid{
    grid-template-columns:1fr;
  }

  .content h2{
    font-size:31px;
  }
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<nav>
  <a class="logo" href="index.html">H<span>.</span></a>
  <a class="home" href="index.html">← Home</a>
</nav>

<main>

<header class="hero">
  <div class="eyebrow">Personal Profile</div>
  <h1>About <span>Husain</span></h1>
  <p>Researcher • Future Doctor • Lifelong Learner</p>
</header>

<section class="profile">

  <div class="photo-wrap">
    <img
      class="photo"
      src="profile.jpg"
      alt="Husain Farooqui">
  </div>

  <div class="content">

    <div class="eyebrow">Who I Am</div>

    <h2>
      Curious by nature.<br>
      <span>Driven by discovery.</span>
    </h2>

    <p>
      I am Husain Farooqui, a student with a strong interest in
      science, medicine, technology and research. I enjoy understanding
      how things work and turning that curiosity into learning and
      practical projects.
    </p>

    <p>
      My academic journey is focused on building a strong foundation
      for medicine and preparing for NEET. Alongside academics, I explore
      programming, artificial intelligence, web development and scientific
      concepts beyond the classroom.
    </p>

    <p>
      I believe learning should never stop — every question is an
      opportunity to understand something better.
    </p>

  </div>

</section>

<section class="grid">

  <article class="card">
    <div class="icon">🧬</div>
    <h3>Medicine & Biology</h3>
    <p>
      Building a strong foundation in biology, anatomy, physiology
      and medical science with the long-term goal of becoming a doctor.
    </p>
  </article>

  <article class="card">
    <div class="icon">🔬</div>
    <h3>Research</h3>
    <p>
      Interested in scientific thinking, evidence, meaningful questions
      and the process of turning knowledge into useful discoveries.
    </p>
  </article>

  <article class="card">
    <div class="icon">🤖</div>
    <h3>AI & Technology</h3>
    <p>
      Exploring artificial intelligence and digital tools, especially
      their potential to improve productivity, learning and healthcare.
    </p>
  </article>

  <article class="card">
    <div class="icon">💻</div>
    <h3>Building & Learning</h3>
    <p>
      Learning Python, HTML, CSS and JavaScript while building projects
      and experimenting with new ideas.
    </p>
  </article>

</section>

<section class="wide">
  <h2>My Journey</h2>
  <p>
    My current focus is becoming academically strong, developing
    disciplined learning habits and preparing for the path toward
    medicine while continuously building technology skills.
  </p>
</section>

<section class="wide">
  <h2>Future Vision</h2>
  <p>
    I want to explore the intersection of medicine, artificial
    intelligence, research and innovation, and eventually build useful
    solutions that can make healthcare and scientific work more effective.
  </p>
</section>

<section class="wide">
  <h2>Current Focus</h2>
  <p>
    Science and medical foundations • NEET preparation • Python •
    Web development • Artificial Intelligence • Research-oriented
    thinking • Digital productivity.
  </p>
</section>

<footer>
  © 2026 Husain Farooqui • Built with curiosity, science and code.
</footer>

</main>

</body>
</html>
